    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d548">

                <pb facs="0609" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg559"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Prince
                            Cantacuzène.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>My <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Prince</hi>: The President and Mrs.
                    Cleveland, the members of his Cabinet and their wives, and Mr. Bayard, our
                    ambassador at London, and his wife, will testify their respect for the memory of
                    the late Emperor by attending the funeral services at your legation on Friday at
                    10 o’clock a.m.</p>
                <p>I have requested the chief of police to call and receive any directions you might
                    desire to make for the occasion.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
